# Commits that only moved whitespace. `git blame` skips them so the line
# points at whoever last changed the code, not the last reformat.
#
# Enable locally (once):
#   git config blame.ignoreRevsFile .git-blame-ignore-revs
#
# GitHub's blame view honours this file with no configuration.
#
# Only add a commit whose source changes are provably formatting-only. One
# that mixes a reformat with a behaviour change must NOT be listed — blame
# would hide the behaviour change too. Dependency manifests and lockfiles
# riding along are fine; blame on generated pins carries no information.

